    "instructionsEn": "Play the twelve bars with your right hand, one chord per bar at 60 BPM: C7 in 1-4, F7 in 5-6, C7 in 7-8, G7 in 9, F7 in 10, C7 in 11 and G7 in 12. Count the four-bar groups out loud and feel the turnaround at the end.",
