    "fingeringEs": "Mano derecha: 1-2-3-4 para las séptimas en estado fundamental. Buscá el movimiento mínimo entre Do7 y Fa7 y mantené el pulso estable; el turnaround no se acelera.",
    "fingeringEn": "Right hand: 1-2-3-4 for root-position sevenths. Look for the smallest movement between C7 and F7 and keep the pulse steady; the turnaround does not speed up.",
